ga_4(){return"The account is optional. Without an account, Mirinu asks for neither your name nor your email address. Your library, your ratings and your settings stay on your device: in the app on Android, in the browser's storage on app.mirinu.ch, without cookies. A file you import is read on the spot and sent nowhere."},
ga_3(){return"Before a code is emailed, a Cloudflare anti-bot check (Turnstile) reads your IP address and information about your browser. The relay also asks Cloudflare whether the domain of your address (what follows the @) receives email; neither your full address nor your IP address goes there. To curb abuse, the relay also counts requests per email address and per IP address, in an unreadable form erased the next day. These protections rest on the legitimate interest in protecting the service."},
gZW(){return"Your data is on your devices and, if you use sync or an account, on the Mirinu relay: an encrypted copy of your library and, with an account, your email address, encrypted."},
